        <rich_text><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-size: 18pt; background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;"><strong>Section C - House of Commons Administration Assets</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">This section is designed to help service areas and managers track the assets of the House Administration that are provided to Administration employees for telework purposes. The employee and the employee’s manager must discuss equipment requirements and record the assets provided under this telework agreement.</span></p>
<p><span style="margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Select the appropriate description of the Administration assets from the drop-down menu below, and enter the barcodes for the IT equipment (other assets will typically not have barcodes):</span></p>
<ul style="list-style-position: inside;"><li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Select <em>Hybrid</em> for portable assets that are used at both the telework location and the designated workplace.</li><li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Select <em>Telework</em> for assets that are used at the telework location only.</li></ul>]]></rich_text>
